        { "text", text = "Back to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Gakin the Darkbinder|r. Use the |cOXP_LOOT_Bloodstone Choker|r at the summoning circle in the |cOXP_PICK_Slaughtered Lamb|r's cellar and defeat the voidwalker it calls." },
