        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Josephine Carson|r stands with the Goldshire trainers. Each of her quests hands you a |cOXP_LOOT_Taming Rod|r: use it on the beast she names, then bring the rod back to her. Rockhide Boars and Young Forest Bears roam the hills south of the Maclure Vineyards, Gray Forest Wolves the woods east of Crystal Lake." },
