      {
        { "text", text = "The Stonefield Farm" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Homer Stonefield|r sells the Shiny Red Apples for the Applejack Still. Apples looted from kobolds and crates count too: the purchase ticks itself once you have four." },
