      {
        { "text", text = "The Applejack Still" },
        { "text", text = "The Applejack Still stands north of the Westbrook Garrison. Click it with four Shiny Red Apples in your bags: it takes them and gives you a |cOXP_LOOT_Thunder Applejack|r on the spot (the quest never shows in your quest log). Keep the Applejack for |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Sergeant De Vries|r: don't drink it." },
        { "goto", x = 24.55, y = 58.04, zone = "1429" },
