      { only = "NightElf Warrior",
        { "text", text = "Elanaria" },
        { "text", text = "At 10, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Kyra Windblade|r, the warrior trainer in Dolanaar, or |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Moon Priestess Amara|r, who patrols the road west of Dolanaar, sends you to Elanaria on the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus. Any Alliance warrior may take one of the three roads, never two: in Stormwind at 10 anyway? |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ilsa Corbin|r's A Warrior's Training teaches the same stance after one fight in a tavern." },
