        { "text", text = "|cOXP_ENEMY_Ice Claw Bear|r" },
        { "text", text = "Dismiss the leopard. Ice Claw Bears (level 7-8) roam the hills around Kharanos, many south-east of it and more north-west toward Anvilmar; their Ice Claw hits hard, so start at full health." },
