        { "text", text = "Dismiss the spider first (right-click the pet portrait, Dismiss Pet): a released practice pet can turn on you. Nightsaber Stalkers (level 7-8) lie on the hillside south of Lake Al'Ameth, south of Dolanaar; the plain Nightsabers by the village do not count." },
