        { "text", text = "Back upstairs in the |cOXP_PICK_Hall of Mysteries|r. |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tiza Battleforge|r gives you the |cOXP_LOOT_Symbol of Life|r; her husband |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Muiredon Battleforge|r rests on the same floor. Keep the symbol: you need it on |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Narm Faulk|r. If you lose it, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tiza Battleforge|r gives you another (The |cOXP_LOOT_Symbol of Life|r)." },
