        { "text", text = "The Dark Iron Spies (level 9-11, twelve of them) sneak around the little house below the lake, just south of Narm; you see them from his hill. About one kill in two drops the |cOXP_LOOT_Dark Iron Script|r. They run for help at low health: finish them or step back. They respawn in three minutes." },
