      {
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Nipsy|r" },
        { "text", text = "Ride the tram to Stormwind: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Nipsy|r waits on the Stormwind platform. |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Furen Longbeard|r stands in the |cOXP_PICK_Dwarven District|r, just outside the tram." },
