        { "text", text = "West along the road toward the city. Shayla walks this stretch of road, from the arrow south-west to the bend at about 38,54 and back: if she isn't at the arrow, follow the road south-west. Every Gnarlpine furbolg drops fangs: the ambushers on this road, the barrow's and Gnarlpine Hold's all count." },
