        { "text", text = "At 10 in Elwynn Forest, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Priestess Josetta|r, upstairs in the Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire, hands you a Confounding Flash letter for |cOXP_FRIENDLY_High Priestess Mims|r in Ironforge." },
