        { "text", text = "At 10 in Elwynn Forest, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Priestess Josetta|r, upstairs in the Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire, hands you a Desperate Prayer letter for |cOXP_FRIENDLY_High Priest Rohan|r in Ironforge (the Deeprun Tram from Stormwind's |cOXP_PICK_Dwarven District|r)." },
