        { "text", text = "At 10 in Teldrassil, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Laurna Morninglight|r, in the building at the north edge of Dolanaar, hands you a Desperate Prayer letter for |cOXP_FRIENDLY_High Priest Rohan|r in Ironforge." },
