        { "text", text = "Hand the letter to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_High Priest Rohan|r in the |cOXP_PICK_Hall of Mysteries|r, Ironforge's |cOXP_PICK_Mystic Ward|r: from Teldrassil, the boat from Rut'theran Village to Auberdine, the boat to Menethil Harbor and the road north through the Wetlands and Loch Modan (or the boat to Stormwind Harbor and the Deeprun Tram)." },
