        { "text", text = "At 10, go to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_High Priestess Laurena|r at the altar of the Cathedral of Light, in Stormwind's |cOXP_PICK_Cathedral Square|r, and take her quest: she teaches Divine Grace on the spot. No letter needed; one from another trainer works too (next steps). Divine Grace instantly heals a friend below half health and clears Weakened Soul, so you can shield them again (5-minute cooldown); it does not work on yourself. Human priests do not get Desperate Prayer in Forever: this is their spell instead." },
