        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ilsa Corbin|r trains warriors in |cOXP_PICK_Old Town|r, near |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Osric Strang|r's shop; the tram from Ironforge arrives in the |cOXP_PICK_Dwarven District|r, north of it. |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Harry Burlguard|r and |cOXP_ENEMY_Bartleby|r stand together by the |cOXP_PICK_Pig and Whistle Tavern|r there. |cOXP_ENEMY_Bartleby|r fights you for his mug. If |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ilsa Corbin|r doesn't offer A Warrior's Training, go straight to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Harry Burlguard|r: he gives Bartleby the Drunk without it." },
