        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Gryan Stoutmantle|r and |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Captain Danuvin|r stand at the top of the stone tower. |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Quartermaster Lewis|r is in the tower, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Scout Galiaan|r on the south side of the hill, next to the inn and |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Thor|r the gryphon master." },
