        { "text", text = "Cenarion Enclave" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Mathrengyl Bearwalker|r stands upstairs in the druids' building of the Cenarion Enclave. No Herbalism? Buy five |cOXP_LOOT_Earthroot|r on the Auction House first: you need them later." },
