      { only = "Skyborne Druid",
        { "text", text = "Cenarion Enclave" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Mathrengyl Bearwalker|r stands upstairs in the druids' building of the Cenarion Enclave; |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Alfina Nightgaze|r by the Skyborne Portal does not give this quest. Cast Teleport: Moonglade and take |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Silva Fil'naveth|r's flight from the middle of Nighthaven (she flies druids to Rut'theran Village, no flight path needed), then the portal up. No Herbalism? Buy five |cOXP_LOOT_Earthroot|r on the Auction House first: you need them later." },
        { "xp", level = 14, text = "Reach level 14" },
        { "reach", text = "Cenarion Enclave", x = 35.8, y = 11.6, zone = "1457" },
      },
      { only = "Skyborne Druid",
        { "text", text = "Lessons Anew" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Mathrengyl Bearwalker|r stands upstairs in the druids' building of the Cenarion Enclave; |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Alfina Nightgaze|r by the Skyborne Portal does not give this quest. Cast Teleport: Moonglade and take |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Silva Fil'naveth|r's flight from the middle of Nighthaven (she flies druids to Rut'theran Village, no flight path needed), then the portal up. No Herbalism? Buy five |cOXP_LOOT_Earthroot|r on the Auction House first: you need them later." },
