        { "text", text = "Sickly Gazelles" },
        { "text", text = "Use the |cOXP_LOOT_Curative Animal Salve|r on living Sickly Gazelles (level 3): they graze on both sides of the road north of the Crossroads up to the Ashenvale border, north-west of the Crossroads and west of Ratchet. Druid trick: root a gazelle with Entangling Roots, apply the salve before the roots tick, and the root kill counts a second time, so five gazelles can do. Lost a dose? Abandon and retake the quest from |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tonga Runetotem|r for a fresh salve." },
