        { "text", text = "Any humanoid drops |cOXP_LOOT_Linen Cloth|r, and the Tunnel Rats in the Silver Stream Mine drop it while you gather the gems; the Auction House in the |cOXP_PICK_Trade District|r sells it. You hand in ten." },
