      { only = "NightElf Druid/Skyborne Druid",
        { "text", text = "A Lesson to Learn" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Mathrengyl Bearwalker|r stands upstairs in the druids' building of the Cenarion Enclave. Skyborne: cast Teleport: Moonglade and take |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Silva Fil'naveth|r's flight from the middle of Nighthaven (she flies druids to Rut'theran Village, no flight path needed), then the portal up." },
