      },
      { only = "Rogue",
        { "text", text = "Alther's Mill" },
        { "text", text = "Alther's Mill stands east of Lakeshire, up off the road; Blackrock orcs roam near it. Inside, the Practice Lockboxes come back almost at once: pick them until |cOXP_PICK_Lucius's Lockbox|r opens for you (about 25 Lockpicking). Your Lockpicking cap rises 5 per level, so a low character may stall. Some boxes are trapped (a frost trap, for one); the skill still goes up. On Forever level 20 spiders wander near the boxes: clear them first or bring a friend. The lockbox always holds the token and is back two seconds after use. Practise on while it still gives skill: the next class quest needs about 75." },
        { "goto", x = 46.95, y = 44.69, zone = "1433" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 2282, text = "Token of Thievery: 1 (|cOXP_LOOT_Token of Thievery|r: |cOXP_PICK_Lucius's Lockbox|r)" },
      },
