      { only = "NightElf Druid",
        { "text", text = "Trial of the Lake" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Dendrite Starblaze|r stands upstairs in his building in Nighthaven: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart. Shrine Baubles lie in the containers on the floor of Lake Elune'ara, below Nighthaven: take one to the Shrine of Remulos in the north-west, use it there and speak to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tajarri|r. Trial of the Lake runs on a timer: no teleport or Hearthstone until |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tajarri|r has it. Then fly back to Auberdine from Nighthaven." },
