        { "text", text = "The bay wrecks" },
        { "text", text = "Two wrecks lie on the sea floor in the bay north of Auberdine; each holds a lockbox. Reef Crawlers and Encrusted Tide Crawlers line this shore.\nCareful: The murlocs inside the wrecks are close together and fast. They often swim through the hull walls and holes, so you will usually pull extra murlocs." },
