        { "text", text = "East of Buzzbox 323, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Balthule Shadowstrike|r hides at the foot of the tower among the Dark Strand Fanatics. Keep his letter for Delgren in Ashenvale.\nCareful: Dark Strand Voidcallers (28-29) with their voidwalkers and |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Athrikus Narassin|r (31) stand in the tower itself: take the parchments from the Fanatics south of it and keep away from the tower." },
