      {
        { "text", text = "The cave and the |cOXP_ENEMY_Den Mother|r" },
        { "text", text = "The cave lies south of the falls: Scaber Stalks grow all through it, the |cOXP_LOOT_Death Cap|r at the very back. The |cOXP_ENEMY_Den Mother|r lairs in the hills south of the falls." },
